Face–CT Alignment Test Package

Contents:
- ct_dicom/        Original CT DICOM series
- face_scan.ply    Phone-based 3D facial scan
- ct_skin.stl      Skin surface extracted from CT
- face_in_ct.stl   Facial scan aligned into CT space
- alignment_metrics.csv   Quantitative alignment metrics
- RESULT.txt       PASS/FAIL based on predefined criteria

How to view in 3D Slicer:
1. Open 3D Slicer
2. Import ct_dicom as DICOM
3. Load ct_skin.stl and face_in_ct.stl as models
4. Enable 3D view to visually assess alignment

Interpretation:
- PASS indicates acceptable geometric alignment between
  external facial surface and CT-derived skin.
- FAIL indicates mismatch or insufficient alignment quality.
